<title>UK: SOCCER-WALES AND TURKEY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES AND TURKEY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales and Turkey drew 0-0 in a</p>
<p>World Cup European group seven qualifier in Cardiff on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 14,206</p>
<p>    Group seven standings   Pl   W   D   L   F  A   Pts</p>
<p> Wales			     5   2   1   2  13  10   7</p>
<p> Netherlands		     2   2   0   0  10   2   6</p>
<p> Belgium			   2   2   0   0   5   1   6</p>
<p> Turkey			    3   1   1   1   8   2   4</p>
<p> San Marino			4   0   0   4   0  21   0</p>
</text>
